# Shixian's Magical Compendium · destiny Initial Preset Workshop

SillyTavern / Tavern Helper browser extension 'floating window' · current version **v1.18.2**

Provides **initial preset one-click pipeline** for character cards like "Shixian's Magical Compendium + Destiny Poems and Twilight Songs":

> Skills → Equipment → Items → Assets → Background → Summary initial preset JSON → One-click export `destiny_*.preset.json`

The entire process calls **the tavern's current main API** (`SillyTavern.getContext().generateRaw`): the plugin does not save or use any API Keys, model and sampling parameters follow the tavern's existing main API configuration.

---

## I. Feature Overview

- **Step-by-step initial draft generation**: serially calls the main API in the order of Skills → Equipment → Items → Assets → Background → Summary output, with step cards lighting up one by one;
- **Built-in column generation specifications**: basic prompts for Skills/Equipment/Items/Assets are incorporated into "Skills Equipment Items Generation Rules" (format constraints for fields/tags/costs/effects/emblems/total space/settlement/internal assets, etc.);
- **Automatic compliance self-check and repair after generation**: automatically performs one-step self-check and repairs non-compliant items of the four categories according to this specification after initial draft/re-summary completion (can be unchecked to disable);
- **Independent refinement for each step**: each step card has a "refinement frame" — you can fill in your own direction, or click "this step's suggestion" to let AI provide only 2-3 directions for this step; refinement only changes this step, single-threaded no concurrency, changes marked with "✦ This step has been modified";
- **⟳ Re-summary**: after all steps are modified, rebuild P6 summary JSON based on the latest step-by-step content and automatically parse and verify; supports multiple rounds of "modify one step → re-summary";
- **⚡ Quick output mode (single instance)**: all phases are merged into one call, directly output the final JSON (saves tokens, suitable for initial draft outline);
- **World rules · creative restriction injection**: throughout generation and refinement, inject restrictions extracted from the world book "Character Generation" "Character Auxiliary Guidance" and each "Book" entry (attribute formulas, level/tier, rarity consumption, assets/partner fields, etc.), preventing random writing;
- **World book checkbox system**: import only "registers" entries, by default only checks `constant` permanent; **only checked entries will be sent into the AI context**;
- **Automatic world book classification**: displayed in groups by section, supports section/region expand/collapse, all open/all close, search and category filtering (see "IV" for details);
- **One-click export**: isomorphic with `destiny_AI one-click initial preset format.preset.json` (can contain top-level `name/createdAt/updatedAt`, timestamps auto-filled with current values), also supports one-click copy;
- **UI**: Red demon style + glow full-screen multi-page workbench (v1.7.0 onwards, mobile adaptation); main window/font size adjustable (current font size levels see "V·Interface Description").
- **🧠 MMO core · text summary (independent module, off by default)**: when enabled, automatically compresses the latest conversation into a ≤800 character YAML paragraph each time AI completes output…
